#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.rst:2
msgid "randperm"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:1
msgid "Returns a random permutation of integers from ``0`` to ``n - 1``."
msgstr "``0``\\ から\\ ``n - 1``\\ までの整数からなるランダムな順列を返します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:3
msgid ""
"Unlike :func:`torch.randperm`, if the seed is fixed with "
":func:`qfeval_functions.random.seed`, the result must be reproducible on "
"any device.  See :func:`rand` for details."
msgstr ""
":func:`torch.randperm` と異なり、:func:`qfeval_functions.random.seed` "
"でシードを固定した場合、結果はどのデバイスでも再現可能です。詳細は :func:`rand` を参照してください。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:8
msgid "The upper bound (exclusive) of the permutation."
msgstr "順列の上限（含まない）。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:11
msgid "The desired data type of the returned tensor. Default is ``torch.int64``."
msgstr "返されるテンソルの望ましいデータ型。デフォルトは ``torch.int64`` です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:15
msgid ""
"The desired device of the returned tensor. Default uses the current "
"device."
msgstr "返されるテンソルの望ましいデバイス。デフォルトは現在のデバイスを使用します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:19
msgid ""
"A 1-dimensional tensor of length ``n`` containing a random permutation of"
" the integers from ``0`` to ``n - 1``."
msgstr "``0`` から ``n - 1`` までの整数のランダムな順列を含む、長さ ``n`` の1次元テンソル。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:24
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:26
msgid ""
">>> import qfeval_functions\n"
">>> with qfeval_functions.random.seed(1):\n"
"...     x = QF.randperm(10)\n"
">>> x\n"
"tensor([1, 0, 9, 8, 6, 3, 7, 4, 2, 5])"
msgstr ">>> import qfeval_functions\n>>> with qfeval_functions.random.seed(1):\n...     x = QF.randperm(10)\n>>> x\ntensor([1, 0, 9, 8, 6, 3, 7, 4, 2, 5])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:32
msgid ":func:`randint`: Uniform random integers."
msgstr ":func:`randint`: 一様なランダム整数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:33
msgid ":func:`rand`: Uniform random floats on the interval [0, 1)."
msgstr ":func:`rand`: 区間 [0, 1) 上の一様乱数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randperm.randperm:34
msgid "``torch.randperm``: PyTorch's built-in random permutation."
msgstr "``torch.randperm``: PyTorchに組み込まれたランダム順列生成関数。"

